    "<div style=\"background-color:rgb(50, 50, 100); padding:10px;\">\n",
    "\n",
    "# Machine Learning & Data Science Road Map\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1. Data Preprocessing  <span style=\"font-size: 2em;\">🧹</span>\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Data Cleaning**\n",
    "  - Handling duplicates\n",
    "  - Splitting the data into training, validation, and test sets\n",
    "  - Handling missing data\n",
    "  - Identifying and dealing with outliers\n",
    "  - Data scaling and normalization\n",
    "- **Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)**\n",
    "  - Data visualization\n",
    "  - Statistical summaries\n",
    "  - Identifying patterns and outliers\n",
    "- **Feature Engineering**\n",
    "  - Creating new features\n",
    "  - Interaction terms and domain-specific features\n",
    "  - Encoding categorical variables\n",
    "  - Collinearity handling\n",
    "- **Dimensionality Reduction**\n",
    "  - PCA\n",
    "  - t-SNE\n",
    "  - UMAP\n",
    "- **Data Imbalance**\n",
    "  - Techniques: undersampling, oversampling\n",
    "- **Pipelines**\n",
    "  - Structuring ML projects\n",
    "  - Automating preprocessing steps\n",
    "  - Ensuring consistency in workflows\n",
    "- **timeseries**\n",
    "  - Datetime Resampling, Shifting, Rolling, Expanding\n",
    "  - Stationarity, Trend, Seasonality, Time aware feature engineering\n",
    "  - ARMA, ARIMA, SARIMA, Decision TREE\n",
    "\n",
    "## 2. Machine Learning Algorithms  <span style=\"font-size: 2em;\">📈</span>\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Supervised Learning**\n",
    "  - **Regression**\n",
    "    - Linear Regression\n",
    "    - Ridge/Lasso Regression\n",
    "  - **Classification**\n",
    "    - Logistic Regression\n",
    "    - K-Nearest Neighbors\n",
    "    - Support Vector Machines\n",
    "    - Decision Trees and Random Forests\n",
    "    - Gradient Boosting Machines (GBM, XGBoost)\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Unsupervised Learning**\n",
    "  - **Clustering**\n",
    "    - K-Means\n",
    "    - DBSCAN\n",
    "  - **Dimensionality Reduction**\n",
    "    - PCA\n",
    "    - t-SNE\n",
    "    - UMAP\n",
    "  - **Anomaly Detection**\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Ensemble Learning**\n",
    "  - Bagging\n",
    "  - Boosting\n",
    "  - Stacking\n",
    "  - Voting Classifiers\n",
    "\n",
    "## 3. Model Selection and Evaluation <span style=\"font-size: 2em;\">🕵️</span>\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Performance Metrics**\n",
    "  - Classification Metrics (Accuracy, Precision, Recall, F1-Score)\n",
    "  - Regression Metrics (MSE, RMSE, MAE)\n",
    "  - ROC and AUC\n",
    "  - Precision-Recall Curve\n",
    "  - Bias-Variance Tradeoff\n",
    "  - Overfitting vs. Underfitting\n",
    "  - Model Complexity\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Model Validation**\n",
    "  - Cross-Validation (K-Fold, Stratified K-Fold)\n",
    "- **Hyperparameter Tuning**\n",
    "  - Grid Search\n",
    "  - Random Search\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Model Interpretability**\n",
    "  - Feature Importance\n",
    "  - SHAP Values\n",
    "  - LIME\n",
