    "#### 🖥 Sklearn's `SimpleImputer`\n",
    "`SimpleImputer` is a data `Transformer` to replace missing values by a strategy of your choice e.g. mean. <br><br>\n",
    "👉<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.impute.SimpleImputer.html\">Sklearn `SimpleImputer()` documentation</a>\n",
    "`imputer.fit()`\n",
    "* Computes the strategy for that feature \n",
    "* Stores the strategy value as an attribute\n",
    "\n",
    "`imputer.transform()`\n",
    "* Identifies missing values  \n",
    "* Replaces missing value with previously calculated strategy value\n",
    "> - `fit_transform` on **Training Data**: The fit_transform method calculates the required statistic (the impute strategy) and applies the transformation to the training data.\n",
    "> - `transform` on **Test Data**: The transform method applies the same transformation (using the statistic calculated from the training data) to the test data. This ensures consistency and prevents data leakage."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 27,
   "id": "95c84d75-942a-4434-9241-c99be76b217c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
